OL,3,GNEWSACar wash 'worried' about possible
OL,4,Awater use ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FOperators of a car wash have said it
OL,7,Fwill have to "close up" if further
OL,8,Fdrought restrictions are approved.
OL,10,FKlodian Ferati from Pinkmead Car Wash
OL,11,Fin Botley, Hampshire, is "worried"
OL,12,Fabout the potential impact a
OL,13,FNon-Essential Use Ban (NEUB) could have
OL,14,Fon its staff, jobs and customers if
OL,15,Fapproved.
OL,17,FSouthern Water has applied to the
OL,18,FDepartment for Environment, Food &
OL,19,FRural Affairs (Defra) for a Drought
OL,20,FOrder and NEUB, which could prevent
OL,21,Fbusinesses from using water.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
