OL,3,GNEWSACar wash 'worried' about possible
OL,4,Awater use ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency declared more
OL,7,Fthan half of England in drought, and
OL,8,Fsaid as a precautionary measure the ban
OL,9,Fcould be implemented to "protect water
OL,10,Fsupplies and the environment".
